    "body": "## Summary\n\n- increment `auth_version` when the audited moderation flow suspends an account, so pre-suspension access tokens stay invalid after any later reactivation\n- revoke every active browser refresh session with the `ACCOUNT_SUSPENDED` reason inside the same transaction as open-job refunds, the status change, and the enforcement audit\n- extend the focused service test for both the successful sanction and the rejected active-lifecycle path, and document the credential boundary\n\n## Validation\n\n- `git diff --check`\n- the parent realtime lifecycle merge is green on post-merge API/web/runtime, CodeQL, and container workflows\n\nThe Java 21 Maven suite, full container/runtime smoke, payments ledger, platform-fee, CodeQL, and container security workflows run on this exact head.",
